e/Fitness); category filters partition 3+3+3 = 9 total\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Displayed results violate the active price criterion\", \"actual\": \"With price minimum $700 active, the result set (5 products found) includes Breville Barista Express at $699; with minimum $600 it included $549 and $599 products. Search/category/rating criteria were respected, but the price criterion is not.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation of required recommendation content\", \"actual\": \"Admin form accepted a product with only a name and short description: price left at 0, empty image URL, empty affiliate/retailer link, empty full review and zero specifications. Toast said 'Product created successfully' and 'Incomplete Test Product' was added to the admin list and published.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/nonexistent-xyz -> 'Product Not Found' message + 'Browse All Products' link, 0 product cards; /category/bogus -> 'Category Not Found', 0 product cards. No unrelated product data shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing in search, changing category, sort and min-rating selects all re-rendered the grid, order and 'N products found' counter instantly with no reload (e.g. 9 -> 1 for 'SONY'; sort price-asc reordered $199..$2,495). Note: price slider updates the set but with a one-step-stale threshold (recorded under FT-10/CS-12).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Dyson V15 Detect name in the product grid navigated to /product/dyson-v15-detect showing that same product; card image is wrapped in the same /product/<slug> link href\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Buy Now' on Sony WH-1000XM5 opened new tab https://example.com/sony-xm5; all 9 cards have target=_blank rel=noopener external hrefs matching their product (e.g. macbook-pro, philips-hue)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selector on category pages is inert\", \"actual\": \"On /category/home the category dropdown shows 'Home Goods'; selecting 'Fitness' and then 'Tech Gadgets' left the URL at /category/home, the heading/active value at 'Home Goods' and the same 3 Home products displayed. (The same control does work on /products.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/dyson-v15-detect shows name 'Dyson V15 Detect', category badge 'Home', rating 4.7, price $749, brief description, 4 tags (vacuum/cordless/smart-home/cleaning), 5 key specs, hero image, full 424-char review, and Buy Now -> https://example.com/dyson-v15\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Seeded products use relevant categories (Sony headphones/MacBook/Samsung=Tech; Dyson/Philips Hue/Breville=Home; Peloton/Theragun/Bowflex=Fitness) and relevant tags (Dyson: vacuum, cordless, smart-home, cleaning; Samsung: flagship/smartphone/android/camera). Category badge and tag values identical between grid cards and detail pages.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dyson V15 Detect: homepage featured & latest-home ($749), /products card (Home, $749, 4.7, 'Intelligent cordless vacuum with laser dust detection...'), /category/home card (identical), detail page (Home, 4.7, $749, same brief description) all consistent; detail shows full 424-char review with no line-clamp and all 5 specs\"}]}"
